<title>UK: Merrill leads $665 mln two-tranche CCMT bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill leads $665 mln two-tranche CCMT bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITIBANK CREDIT CARD MASTER TRUST 1996-6</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $625 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  LEG MAT     10.DEC.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     13 BP     EXP MAT     11.DEC.06</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES  0.425 PCT MGT/UND     0.05 PCT</p>
<p> SELL CONC  0.375 PCT MOODYS     AAA	 S&amp;P	   AAA</p>
<p>CLASS B</p>
<p> AMT    $40 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  LEG MAT     10.DEC.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     33 BP     EXP MAT     11.DEC.06</p>
<p> ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES  0.475 PCT MGT/UND     0.05 PCT</p>
<p> SELL CONC  0.425 PCT MOODYS     A2	  S&amp;P	   A</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS GLOBAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  PAY FREQ   QUARTERLY TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES     **TO BE PRICED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
